First dive for Sokoban, bypassing any monster you can't handle with E-
word and camera.

Let the cat eat everything except baby Ns, (displace the kitty to get
these) and eat Fs and js for poison resistance.

Find out what kind of potions nymphs carry and change those bottles to
water.  Also use the wands from Sokoban to kill non-gray Unicorns with
trick shots in order to find other potion types to water down.

Pumped up from Sokoban and with plenty of food you can take on the
monsters you bypassed earlier.

Your goal now is to first find a coaligned altar to bless the water
you made then with a luck boost from sacs or stone wish for
Magicbane.  (You will most likely have to get down to minetown, using
mapping scrolls to get the wish)

When you enter the mines you'll want to be inviso, displaced or
reflective to handle the GwaWoD.

If your wish source is a lamp you'll want to wait until you have the
luckstone before trading that in for Magicbane.

Be careful with your starting supply of darts until you have the
chance to take a dozen daggers off orcs, dwarves and halflings.

